BEGIN:VEVENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20230622T062846Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nSleep\nSynopsis\n:\nLearn about the importance of qua
	lity rest for our overall well-being. Explore the science behind sleep cyc
	les\, the effects of sleep deprivation\, and practical strategies for opti
	mizing sleep habits. Discover how unlocking the power of a good night's sl
	eep can enhance our productivity\, mental health\, and overall quality of 
	life.\nSpeaker\n:\nYan Hong LEE\nDr. Michelle Cheung\nJoining Instructions
	\n(In-Person)\n:\nDBS Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay Fi
	nancial Centre Tower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\nJoining Instructi
	ons\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using D
	BS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp
	4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EV
	cKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the
	 event. This will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for o
	ptimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this h
	yperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e
	7716564ccfe56b67dbb7054a6f359fb0> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\,
	 Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	D
	ownload Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick
	 on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2510 686 5933\n2.	Input Password 
	1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\
	nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)
	\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2510 686 593
	3\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID
	=e8b348588cbf111d8933d1b2e9c4a554e> \n \n \n \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230720T155000
